# ============================================================================
# TIPS FOR CUSTOMIZATION
# ============================================================================

# 1. WORKSPACE_DIR: Where your repositories are located
#    - Can be any directory on your system
#    - Use $HOME for portability across machines
#
# 2. SYMLINK_DIR: Where symlinks will be created
#    - Defaults to WORKSPACE_DIR if not specified
#    - Can be different if you want symlinks elsewhere
#
# 3. REPOS: Define each repository with format "name:path:port"
#    - Name: Identifier for the repo (used in commands)
#    - Path: Absolute path to the repository
#    - Port: Default port for development server
#
# 4. PROFILES: Group repositories that work together
#    - Makes it easy to start multiple related repos
#    - Format: "profile-name=repo1,repo2,repo3"
#
# 5. ENV_MAPPINGS: Auto-update environment variables
#    - Format: "source:ENV_VAR:target:offset"
#    - Updates URLs between services automatically
#
# 6. PORT_INCREMENT: How much to increment ports per instance
#    - Default: 1000
#    - Instance 0: base port
#    - Instance 1: base + 1000
#    - Instance 2: base + 2000
#    - etc.
